---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="404 頁面不存在 — KJyang" description="找不到您請求的頁面">
  <section class="min-h-[70vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-6 pt-20">
    <h1 class="text-8xl sm:text-9xl font-black text-gradient mb-4">404</h1>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-4">頁面走丟了</h2>
    <p class="text-zinc-400 mb-8 max-w-md">看來您訪問的頁面已經被程式吃掉了...</p>
    <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-brand hover:bg-brand-dark text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200">
      返回首頁
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" /></svg>
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
